<title>JAPAN: Kansai Super - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kansai Super - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.59		vs	   40.43</p>
<p> Operating	    1.31		vs	    1.28</p>
<p> Current		1.34		vs	    1.28</p>
<p> Net		  680    million    vs	  633    million</p>
<p> EPS		   26.60 yen	  vs	   25.94 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    8.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kansai Super Market Ltd is a medium-scale operator of food supermarkets.</p>
